# GitHub push after every increment

Remote is always `https://github.com/Ganesh2325/AegisTrace` (`origin` on `main`).

When a gated product increment (the user-supplied PHASE prompt) is marked complete and reported:

1. Commit the working tree.
2. Push to that remote immediately. Do not wait to be asked again.
3. Return the commit SHA and the GitHub URL.

Commit messages, README, and files that go to GitHub must not contain `Phase N` / `PHASE N` labels. Keep `docs/phase-roadmap.md` local/untracked unless the user explicitly wants it published.

Examples:

- `feat: add versioned agent control plane`
- Do not write `feat: complete Phase 6`
